observed_reviews.body:
Thanks, confirmed and fixed in 4d5abe038. The SWAP now moves the cache row, and each mode owner has the 113 free-word terms you observed. `mode_outputs` binds every symbol on them to an exact element of G:
- monomials to their literal words;
- `G` to the positive C8 on axes 0..7;
- `Nin_f` to the input wrapper followed by the inverse canonical chart of the entrance frame;
- `N_o` to the chart of the recorded mode frame followed by the literal `output_N` word.

Charts use the backward conjugate convention, as for the ports. Summed in C[G], all 448 y pairs cancel and each owner is exactly `C8 z`, with coefficient +1 and absolute phase. That is the source's `S(-DZy + D(Sz+Zy)) = C8 z`.

There are three checks against false positives. The unconjugated reading leaves all 896 y terms. A sign flip in one `output_N` word is rejected. The drop-the-row mutation is rejected. PROOF.md §3B, README, TASK, VERIFY and RESULT are updated.
